3,"text":"The First Hollow completes Grub.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":265,"player":0,"text":"Skullgrind has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":265,"player":0,"text":"Grimtooth has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":265,"player":0,"text":"Mudhole has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":265,"player":0,"text":"Second Mudhole has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":265,"player":1,"text":"Silverbrook has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":265,"player":1,"text":"Thornwall has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":265,"player":3,"text":"The Queen holds against Knight.","kind":"combat","at":[34,8],"actor":343},{"turn":265,"player":1,"text":"Knight is destroyed attacking.","kind":"bad","at":[33,9]},{"turn":266,"player":0,"text":"Asking Around discovered.","kind":"research","cue":"discovery"},{"turn":266,"player":0,"text":"People will tell you a startling amount about their neighbours if you stand near them and look interested. They will tell you more if you buy the next round, but that is a separate advance and somebody is still costing it.","kind":"info"},{"turn":266,"player":0,"text":"Research begins: A Word In The Wrong Ear.","kind":"research"},{"turn":266,"player":1,"text":"Aldenwatch completes Archer.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":266,"player":1,"text":"Fairhaven has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":267,"player":0,"text":"The peace with The Radiant Kingdom of Bram has run its term and lapsed. Nobody renewed it.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":267,"player":1,"text":"The peace with The Bleeding Skull Horde has run its term and lapsed. Nobody renewed it.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":267,"player":0,"text":"Grimtooth has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":267,"player":0,"text":"Mudhole has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":267,"player":0,"text":"Second Mudhole has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":267,"player":1,"text":"Peasant finishes Tidy Furrows.","kind":"good","at":[10,19]},{"turn":267,"player":1,"text":"Silverbrook has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":267,"player":1,"text":"Thornwall has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":267,"player":1,"text":"Highmarch sells its Chapel of Mild Optimism to cover the books.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":267,"player":3,"text":"The First Hollow completes Grub.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":268,"player":0,"text":"Skullgrind completes Totem of Managed Feelings.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":268,"player":3,"text":"The Queen holds against Four Orcs.","kind":"combat","at":[34,8],"actor":233},{"turn":268,"player":0,"text":"Four Orcs is destroyed attacking.","kind":"bad","at":[35,8]},{"turn":268,"player":0,"text":"All 4 of them, at once. The Bleeding Skull Horde takes it about as well as expected.","kind":"bad","at":[35,8]},{"turn":268,"player":1,"text":"Highmarch completes Chapel of Mild Optimism.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":268,"player":1,"text":"Fairhaven has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":269,"player":0,"text":"Peon finishes a road.","kind":"good","at":[40,35]},{"turn":269,"player":0,"text":"Bonechew completes Axethrower.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":269,"player":0,"text":"Grimtooth has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":269,"player":0,"text":"Mudhole has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":269,"player":0,"text":"Second Mudhole has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":269,"player":0,"text":"Skullgrind sells its Totem of Managed Feelings to cover the books.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":269,"player":1,"text":"Silverbrook has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":269,"player":1,"text":"Thornwall has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":269,"player":1,"text":"Four Orcs has had a better offer, and took it.","kind":"good","at":[35,7]},{"turn":269,"player":3,"text":"The Queen holds against Archer.","kind":"combat","at":[34,8],"actor":334},{"turn":269,"player":1,"text":"Archer is destroyed attacking.","kind":"bad","at":[33,9]},{"turn":269,"player":3,"text":"The First Hollow grows to 6.","kind":"growth","cue":"growth"},{"turn":269,"player":3,"text":"The First Hollow completes Grub.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":269,"player":3,"text":"All Is The Hive discovered.","kind":"research","cue":"discovery"},{"turn":269,"player":3,"text":"Two queens should not have been possible. Two queens were possible. All is the Hive and the Hive are all, and if they were capable of joy, they would be reasonably pleased about this. Not excessively. It is, after all, only the one world.","kind":"info"},{"turn":269,"player":3,"text":"Now buildable: The Molting Chamber, The Second Feeding, The Second Queen's Shell.","kind":"good"},{"turn":269,"player":3,"text":"Research begins: There Were Always This Many.","kind":"research"},{"turn":270,"player":0,"text":"30 turns to the deadline, and you are ahead on points. Long enough to change that, if it is going to be changed.","kind":"info"},{"turn":270,"player":1,"text":"30 turns to the deadline, and The Bleeding Skull Horde is ahead on points. Long enough to change that, if it is going to be changed.","kind":"info"},{"turn":270,"player":3,"text":"30 turns to the deadline, and The Bleeding Skull Horde is ahead on points. Long enough to change that, if it is going to be changed.","kind":"info"},{"turn":270,"player":0,"text":"Skullgrind has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":270,"player":1,"text":"Peasant finishes Tidy Furrows.","kind":"good","at":[10,20]},{"turn":270,"player":1,"text":"Aldenwatch completes Archer.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":270,"player":1,"text":"Fairhaven has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":270,"player":3,"text":"The Queen holds against Four Orcs.","kind":"combat","at":[34,8],"actor":252},{"turn":270,"player":1,"text":"Four Orcs is destroyed attacking.","kind":"bad","at":[35,7]},{"turn":270,"player":1,"text":"All 4 of them, at once. The Radiant Kingdom of Bram takes it about as well as expected.",